  "demo": {
    "title": "暗さと輪郭の重みを動かす",
    "caption": "窓辺の植物、候補1000個、暗さの重み65%、勾配基準180、線長16px、線幅3、シード42が初期値です。重みスライダーを動かし、確率マップと筆跡の変化を比べます。",
    "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"ja\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;padding:12px;background:#f3f0e7;color:#29383d;font:15px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}.controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(138px,1fr));gap:8px}label{display:grid;gap:4px;font-size:13px}select,input,button{min-height:44px;padding:7px 9px;border:1px solid #c8c1b5;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;color:inherit;font:inherit}input[type=range]{padding:0;accent-color:#3d7d83}.alpha{grid-column:span 2}.alphaLine{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.alphaLine input{flex:1}.alphaLine output{min-width:48px;text-align:right;font-weight:700}.check{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.check input{width:22px;height:22px}.views{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px;margin-top:12px}.panel{min-width:0}.panel strong{display:block;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:13px}canvas{width:100%;display:block;aspect-ratio:1.48;border:1px solid #cfc8bb;background:#fff}.note{min-height:1.6em;margin:7px 0;color:#52666a;font-size:13px}@media(max-width:760px){.views{grid-template-columns:1fr}canvas{aspect-ratio:1.55}}@media(max-width:480px){body{padding:8px}.controls{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.alpha{grid-column:span 2}}</style></head><body><div class=\"controls\"><label>シード<input id=\"seed\" type=\"number\" value=\"42\"></label><label>候補数<select id=\"count\"><option>400</option><option selected>1000</option><option>2000</option><option>3000</option></select></label><label>元画像<select id=\"source\"><option value=\"plant\" selected>窓辺の植物</option><option value=\"apple\">りんごと影</option><option value=\"wave\">波と水面</option></select></label><label>勾配基準<select id=\"reference\"><option>90</option><option selected>180</option><option>360</option></select></label><label class=\"alpha\">暗さを重視する重み α<div class=\"alphaLine\"><span>輪郭</span><input id=\"alpha\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"5\" value=\"65\"><span>暗さ</span><output id=\"alphaText\" for=\"alpha\">65%</output></div></label><label>線の長さ<select id=\"length\"><option>10</option><option selected>16</option><option>24</option></select></label><label>線幅<select id=\"width\"><option>1</option><option selected>3</option><option>5</option></select></label><label>色<select id=\"color\"><option value=\"sample\" selected>画素の色</option><option value=\"gray\">白黒</option><option value=\"warm\">朱色</option></select></label><label class=\"check\"><input id=\"guides\" type=\"checkbox\">勾配の向きを表示</label><button id=\"redraw\" type=\"button\">描き直す</button><button id=\"newseed\" type=\"button\">別のシード</button></div><div class=\"views\"><div class=\"panel\"><strong>元画像 <span id=\"guideLabel\"></span></strong><canvas id=\"sourceCanvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"サンプリング元の植物画像と勾配の向き\"></canvas></div><div class=\"panel\"><strong>採用確率マップ</strong><canvas id=\"mapCanvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"暗さと勾配の重み付き平均で作る確率マップ\"></canvas></div><div class=\"panel\"><strong>確率抽選で残った筆跡</strong><canvas id=\"resultCanvas\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"暗さと輪郭の重みを調整して描いた筆跡の結果\"></canvas></div></div><p id=\"note\" class=\"note\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><script>\nconst src=document.querySelector(\"#sourceCanvas\"),sc=src.getContext(\"2d\"),map=document.querySelector(\"#mapCanvas\"),mc=map.getContext(\"2d\"),out=document.querySelector(\"#resultCanvas\"),ctx=out.getContext(\"2d\");\nfunction grayAt(data,w,h,x,y){x=Math.max(0,Math.min(w-1,x));y=Math.max(0,Math.min(h-1,y));const i=(y*w+x)*4;return .299*data[i]+.587*data[i+1]+.114*data[i+2]}\nfunction makeSource(w,h,mode){sc.fillStyle=\"#f4f0e6\";sc.fillRect(0,0,w,h);if(mode===\"plant\"){sc.fillStyle=\"#bad6ce\";sc.fillRect(0,0,w*.34,h);sc.strokeStyle=\"#f4efe3\";sc.lineWidth=10;sc.beginPath();sc.moveTo(w*.17,0);sc.lineTo(w*.17,h);sc.moveTo(0,h*.47);sc.lineTo(w*.34,h*.47);sc.stroke();sc.strokeStyle=\"#536b50\";sc.lineWidth=6;sc.beginPath();sc.moveTo(w*.58,h*.88);sc.lineTo(w*.53,h*.2);sc.stroke();for(let i=0;i<6;i++){const x=w*(.45+(i%2)*.13),y=h*(.25+Math.floor(i/2)*.15),a=i%2?-.45:-2.7;sc.save();sc.translate(x,y);sc.rotate(a);sc.fillStyle=i%3?\"#6c8d69\":\"#405e4b\";sc.beginPath();sc.ellipse(0,0,w*.12,h*.045,0,0,Math.PI*2);sc.fill();sc.restore()}sc.fillStyle=\"#bd7559\";sc.beginPath();sc.moveTo(w*.44,h*.75);sc.lineTo(w*.7,h*.75);sc.lineTo(w*.66,h*.98);sc.lineTo(w*.48,h*.98);sc.closePath();sc.fill()}else if(mode===\"apple\"){sc.fillStyle=\"#e9dfce\";sc.fillRect(0,0,w,h*.8);sc.fillStyle=\"#7b6651\";sc.beginPath();sc.ellipse(w*.5,h*.8,w*.23,h*.05,0,0,Math.PI*2);sc.fill();sc.beginPath();sc.moveTo(w*.5,h*.22);sc.bezierCurveTo(w*.23,h*.12,w*.2,h*.48,w*.31,h*.68);sc.bezierCurveTo(w*.4,h*.83,w*.6,h*.82,w*.71,h*.66);sc.bezierCurveTo(w*.82,h*.46,w*.77,h*.14,w*.53,h*.22);sc.closePath();const g=sc.createLinearGradient(w*.27,0,w*.75,0);g.addColorStop(0,\"#d48965\");g.addColorStop(.58,\"#a95740\");g.addColorStop(1,\"#483135\");sc.fillStyle=g;sc.fill();sc.strokeStyle=\"#554537\";sc.lineWidth=5;sc.beginPath();sc.moveTo(w*.5,h*.24);sc.lineTo(w*.53,h*.11);sc.stroke()}else{sc.fillStyle=\"#9fc6cc\";sc.fillRect(0,0,w,h);for(let i=0;i<8;i++){const y=h*(.15+i*.1);sc.strokeStyle=[\"#e5ede3\",\"#69a4ae\",\"#3f7787\",\"#d4e5dc\"][i%4];sc.lineWidth=2+i%3;sc.beginPath();sc.moveTo(0,y);for(let x=0;x<=w;x+=4)sc.lineTo(x,y+Math.sin(x*.025+i)*h*.022);sc.stroke()}}}\nfunction probability(gray,m,alpha,ref){const dark=1-gray/255,strength=Math.min(m/ref,1);return alpha*dark+(1-alpha)*strength}\nfunction draw(){const box=src.getBoundingClientRect(),d=Math.min(devicePixelRatio||1,2),w=Math.max(1,box.width),h=Math.max(1,box.height);for(const c of [src,map,out]){c.width=Math.round(w*d);c.height=Math.round(h*d)}sc.setTransform(d,0,0,d,0,0);mc.setTransform(1,0,0,1,0,0);ctx.setTransform(d,0,0,d,0,0);makeSource(w,h,document.querySelector(\"#source\").value);const pix=sc.getImageData(0,0,src.width,src.height).data,alpha=Number(document.querySelector(\"#alpha\").value)/100,reference=Number(document.querySelector(\"#reference\").value),length=Number(document.querySelector(\"#length\").value),lineWidth=Number(document.querySelector(\"#width\").value),colorMode=document.querySelector(\"#color\").value;\nconst mapData=mc.createImageData(map.width,map.height);for(let y=0;y<map.height;y++)for(let x=0;x<map.width;x++){const k=(y*map.width+x)*4,gx=grayAt(pix,src.width,src.height,x+1,y)-grayAt(pix,src.width,src.height,x-1,y),gy=grayAt(pix,src.width,src.height,x,y+1)-grayAt(pix,src.width,src.height,x,y-1),gray=grayAt(pix,src.width,src.height,x,y),p=probability(gray,Math.hypot(gx,gy),alpha,reference),v=Math.round(255*p);mapData.data[k]=Math.round(246-p*112);mapData.data[k+1]=Math.round(241-p*132);mapData.data[k+2]=Math.round(229-p*145);mapData.data[k+3]=255}mc.putImageData(mapData,0,0);\nctx.fillStyle=\"#f4f0e6\";ctx.fillRect(0,0,w,h);let seed=Math.floor(Number(document.querySelector(\"#seed\").value)||1);seed=(seed-1)%2147483646+1;function random(){seed=seed*16807%2147483647;return(seed-1)/2147483646}const count=Number(document.querySelector(\"#count\").value);let kept=0;\nfor(let i=0;i<count;i++){const x=random()*w,y=random()*h,ix=Math.floor(x*d),iy=Math.floor(y*d),k=(iy*src.width+ix)*4,r=pix[k],g=pix[k+1],b=pix[k+2],gray=.299*r+.587*g+.114*b,gx=grayAt(pix,src.width,src.height,ix+1,iy)-grayAt(pix,src.width,src.height,ix-1,iy),gy=grayAt(pix,src.width,src.height,ix,iy+1)-grayAt(pix,src.width,src.height,ix,iy-1),m=Math.hypot(gx,gy),pDark=1-gray/255,strength=Math.min(m/reference,1),p=alpha*pDark+(1-alpha)*strength,angle=m<4?0:Math.atan2(gy,gx)+Math.PI/2;if(random()<p){kept++;let color;if(colorMode===\"sample\")color=\"rgb(\"+r+\",\"+g+\",\"+b+\")\";else if(colorMode===\"gray\"){const v=Math.round(gray);color=\"rgb(\"+v+\",\"+v+\",\"+v+\")\"}else color=\"#c35d44\";ctx.strokeStyle=color;ctx.lineWidth=lineWidth;ctx.lineCap=\"round\";ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x-Math.cos(angle)*length/2,y-Math.sin(angle)*length/2);ctx.lineTo(x+Math.cos(angle)*length/2,y+Math.sin(angle)*length/2);ctx.stroke()}}\nif(document.querySelector(\"#guides\").checked){for(let y=18;y<h;y+=34)for(let x=18;x<w;x+=34){const ix=Math.floor(x*d),iy=Math.floor(y*d),gx=grayAt(pix,src.width,src.height,ix+1,iy)-grayAt(pix,src.width,src.height,ix-1,iy),gy=grayAt(pix,src.width,src.height,ix,iy+1)-grayAt(pix,src.width,src.height,ix,iy-1),m=Math.hypot(gx,gy);if(m<4)continue;const a=Math.atan2(gy,gx),n=8;sc.strokeStyle=\"rgba(35,48,52,.8)\";sc.lineWidth=1.3;sc.beginPath();sc.moveTo(x-Math.cos(a)*n/2,y-Math.sin(a)*n/2);sc.lineTo(x+Math.cos(a)*n/2,y+Math.sin(a)*n/2);sc.stroke()}}\ndocument.querySelector(\"#alphaText\").textContent=Math.round(alpha*100)+\"%\";document.querySelector(\"#guideLabel\").textContent=document.querySelector(\"#guides\").checked?\"（矢印は明るくなる方向）\":\"\";document.querySelector(\"#note\").textContent=\"候補 \"+count+\" 個 · 採用 \"+kept+\" 個 · 暗さの重み α=\"+Math.round(alpha*100)+\"% · 勾配基準 \"+reference;}\nfor(const id of [\"seed\",\"count\",\"source\",\"reference\",\"alpha\",\"length\",\"width\",\"color\",\"guides\"]){const e=document.querySelector(\"#\"+id);e.addEventListener(\"change\",draw);e.addEventListener(\"input\",draw)}document.querySelector(\"#redraw\").addEventListener(\"click\",draw);document.querySelector(\"#newseed\").addEventListener(\"click\",()=>{const e=document.querySelector(\"#seed\");e.value=String((Number(e.value)||1)+1);draw()});window.addEventListener(\"resize\",draw);window.addEventListener(\"message\",e=>{if(e.data?.type!==\"gal-experiment\")return;for(const c of e.data.controls||[]){const el=document.querySelector(c.selector);if(el){el.value=c.value;el.dispatchEvent(new Event(\"change\"))}}});requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n</script></body></html>"
  },
